{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 161702, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 110512, "uid": 176744, "type": 4, "title": "星云摩根偷跑攻略（星云困难火boss通用）", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1657271397, "updated_at": 1659741067, "updated_uid": 176744, "comment_at": 1669771527, "last_at": 1684078106, "comment_count": 7, "status": 1, "summary": "前言可以说在星云困难4的boss都是过家家难度，然后当你美滋滋的刷到这里摩根就会突然暴起給你一刀狠的。因为本人前面都在用木队偷跑所以直接被卡在这里半个月。本攻略目前只适用于有一个桂花但是没抽满的低加混", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_441/h_457/1164/176744/2022/6/8/79349.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_553/h_670/1164/176744/2022/6/8/209182.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_828/h_537/1164/176744/2022/6/8/710225.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5631, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 3, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 161702, "content": "<div><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"338\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_338/1164/176744/2022/6/8/372421.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_338/1164/176744/2022/6/8/372421.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; height: 241.484px; width: 711.891px;\"><br></div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"line-height: 3;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">前言</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;可以说在星云困难4的boss都是过家家难度，然后当你美滋滋的刷到这里摩根就会突然暴起給你一刀狠的。因为本人前面都在用木队偷跑所以直接被卡在这里半个月。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本攻略目前只适用于有一个桂花但是没抽满的低加混子，氪佬和真大佬就当个乐呵。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">BOSS资料</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;具体技能我们无法浏览但大致可以知道分别是</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">一个3体流血然后给自己充能加速，一个三体涌刃（tnnd！2秒掉个1000伤，就是为了躲开伪娘的n）和给自己闪避后加伤技能。然后ds全体砍一刀后上流血。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;摩根的主要难点就是你要保持高频的攻击频率来不让他充能的同时，还得顶住他的高额伤害。因为自身是流血和涌刃的混伤所以伪娘还不能很好单防，血又厚的一比，你不手操低加根本打不死。（不对不手操你不仅打不死，她还要打死你。）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">对<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">策</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"563\" data-height=\"151\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_563/h_151/1164/176744/2022/6/8/113723.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_563/h_151/1164/176744/2022/6/8/113723.png\" style=\"height: 186px; width: 719.484px;\"></div>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">这就是我一开始想的队伍，下任意一个加成位换奶（是谁无所谓就是个奶），然后就卡住了。你下了一个辅助最跟本的问题就是伤害不够了。（我感觉高加的桂花这个阵容也不够斩）至于为什么不带回血人偶而是<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">上奶</span>，你猜猜我为什么打星云（打星云站不住--那你上人偶啊--我没人偶--那你打星云啊--我站不住--那你上人偶啊）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">那么有没有一位角色，可以减少boss输出，又能让队伍快速循呢？</span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这里就要请出我们的无敌甜甜圈了</span></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img data-width=\"441\" data-height=\"457\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_441/h_457/1164/176744/2022/6/8/79349.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_441/h_457/1164/176744/2022/6/8/79349.png\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 16px;\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Ns&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">buff最多的敌人优<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">先</span>，80%的概率把抢夺一个buff到自己身上。<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span></span></span><span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-size:12px;\"></span></div></div><div></div></div></span></div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">甜甜圈只需要在场上不断打n就可以把boss的所有buff都抢到自己身上。不用高加不用点火，只需要一开始多凹几次抢过来boss的加速，再低的概率在甜甜圈1s一个n的情况下也会被牛走。<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">这里可能有小可爱会问了，那和我上奶有什么区别呢，同样是一个位置，你又不能把牛过来的buff给刀。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;没错！如果说奶是靠抬自身血线来保证存活的话，甜甜圈的作用就是牛走boss的加速和加伤来降低boss的伤害。<span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">最最最关键的是，甜甜圈能牛走boss的充能加速技能。</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">你会发现上了甜甜圈后，她只要抢到了加速buff，自己就会疯狂鬼畜充能手操的时候1s打一下n都不是问题。能减伤，能加速能给ds充能。（通用辅助确信无疑.jpg）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">最终阵容<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></span></div></div><br></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"667\" data-height=\"390\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_390/1164/176744/2022/6/8/611142.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_667/h_390/1164/176744/2022/6/8/611142.png\" style=\"height: 344.91px; width: 589.875px;\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这就是我打着层boss的配置，除了杜鹃花武器魂卡要点需求外，其他的辅助就那个血量高选哪个就行，魂卡没有硬性要求，武器3号词条最好带吸血而不是增伤。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">技能的话：</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"></div></div><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span><img data-width=\"72\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/941847.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/941847.png\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">你只需要在你有空闲的时候不停的点甜甜圈来打n就行</span></span></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp;<img data-width=\"71\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/553218.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/553218.png\">&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">有s就打，尼禄提相当与你这个阵容的奶。（冷知识尼禄提的ss是直接加在你生命上限上，技能结束后只扣除上限，相当于奶plus，海王星奢华版）</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">建议高加</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp;<img data-width=\"71\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/910162.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/910162.png\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">建议3红开启n和s的两回合，这样你就可以随便点，感觉差不多了打s，没事了点点n这种。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp;<img data-width=\"72\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/462997.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/462997.png\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">snnnnnnnnnnnn，身上有加速就不停点n，身上有流血但加速没了也优先点n。（不差你那点加速真的，活着才有输出</span></span></span>）<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">建议高加&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp;<img data-width=\"71\" data-height=\"72\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_72/1164/176744/2022/6/8/332384.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_72/1164/176744/2022/6/8/332384.png\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">杜鹃花优先打n，有穿甲buff的时候没事哗啦几下打打s就行。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">建议+2起步</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span></span></div></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"></div></div><br></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><div style=\"\"></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><div style=\"\">&nbsp;ds方面：</div><div style=\"\"></div></span><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"71\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/260644.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/260644.png\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span><img data-width=\"71\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/43003.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_71/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/43003.png\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">&nbsp;1和2的ds可以任选1个，忙着解开debuff就开尼禄提，很稳就开阿罗汉。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"72\" data-height=\"71\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/906683.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_72/h_71/1164/176744/2022/6/8/906683.png\">&nbsp;伪娘ds进ft。</div><div class=\"div-img\">（<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">连点器，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">连点器，</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">连点器！</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span>重要的事情说三遍，有没有连点器完全是两个体验）</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span><span><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">结语</span></span></span></div></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;总的来说只要多凹几次过boss肯定是没问题的，我这个阵容过boss都还剩了整整1分多。所以再弱一点肯定是没问题的。附上我杜鹃的装备和魂卡</div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"553\" data-height=\"670\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_553/h_670/1164/176744/2022/6/8/209182.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_553/h_670/1164/176744/2022/6/8/209182.png\" style=\"height: 715px; width: 590.142px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img data-width=\"828\" data-height=\"537\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_828/h_537/1164/176744/2022/6/8/710225.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_828/h_537/1164/176744/2022/6/8/710225.png\" style=\"height: 381.979px; width: 588.984px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">&nbsp; &nbsp;只能说是勉勉强强的及格水准了，相信大家努努力都能搞到。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title3\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"></div></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">附上结束画面：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2560\" data-height=\"1440\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2560/h_1440/1164/176744/2022/6/8/218945.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2560/h_1440/1164/176744/2022/6/8/218945.jpg\"></div><br></span></span></div></span></div><span style=\"font-siz